flowchart TD
    Client[POS / Admin Client] --> API[Express API]
    API --> MW[Security Headers / Request Context / Logger]
    MW --> AUTH[JWT Authentication]
    AUTH --> ROUTES[Versioned API Routes]
    ROUTES --> BILL[Billing Module]
    ROUTES --> INV[Inventory Module]
    ROUTES --> USERS[Users & RBAC Module]
    ROUTES --> RX[Prescriptions Module]
    ROUTES --> REPORTS[Reports Module]
    BILL --> TX[Transactional Service Layer]
    INV --> TX
    TX --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    USERS --> DB
    RX --> DB
    REPORTS --> DB
    TX --> AUDIT[Audit Log Records]
    AUDIT --> DB